    "chunk_text": "for \u00feynre m\u00e6r\u00f0e \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feu hate hyne cuman hyder to Pilatus \u00fea swa dyde, het geclypian hys \u00e6nne rynel & hym to cw\u00e6\u00f0 myd gewyssum gesceade, yrn & Se rynel \u00fea swa dyde & myd mycelum ofste w\u00e6s for\u00f0 yrnende & \u00feone H\u00e6lend gemetende & hyne & he \u00fea sona on eor\u00f0an astrehte \u00fe\u00e6t he on handa b\u00e6r \u00fe\u00e6t w\u00e6s hr\u00e6geles sum d\u00e6l & hymsylf \u00fear wy\u00f0 Ac se H\u00e6lend hym \u00fea gyt ne andswarode. & eac \u00fea Iudeas gesawon hu se rynel h\u00e6fde geeadmet to \u00feam H\u00e6lende & clypodon to Pilate & & hig sona \u00fea eall atealdon \u00fe\u00e6t hig be \u00feam rynele gesawon. Pilatus hym het \u00fea \u00f0\u00e6ne rynel to geclypian & hyne sona acsode for hwig he swa dyde. Se rynel hym andswarode & cw\u00e6\u00f0, \u00fea \u00f0a \u00feu asendest me to Hierusalem to Alexandre cyninge \u00fea \u00dea Iudeas \u00fea cw\u00e6don to \u00feam rynele, \u00fea cnyhtas w\u00e6ron Hebreisce \u00fea spr\u00e6con hig eac on Ebreisc, & Se rynel heom andswarode & cw\u00e6\u00f0, Ic acsode sumne Hebreiscne hw\u00e6t hig s\u00e6don & he hyt me sona \u00d0a cw\u00e6\u00f0 Pilatus, hu clypedon hig & hu by\u00f0 hyt getrahtnod on Hebreisc? Se rynel hym andswarode & cw\u00e6\u00f0, hig cw\u00e6don, La Dryhten, beo \u00feu hal & sig gebletsod se \u00f0e on \u00d0a cw\u00e6\u00f0 Pilatus to \u00feam Iudeum, nu ge magon eac beon gewytnysse",
